{"name":"Plunging Waterfall","hex":"#8cd4df","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"plunging","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of plunge"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["That descends steeply.","Aimed from higher ground, as fire upon an enemy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/plunging"},{"term":"waterfall","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A flow of water over the edge of a cliff.","A waterfall-like outpouring of liquid, smoke, etc."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To fall like a waterfall.","To drink (something) from a container by pouring it from a height so as not to touch one's lips to the rim."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/waterfall"}],"entries":[{"title":"Diving (sport)","blocks":[{"text":"Diving is the sport of jumping or falling into water from a platform or springboard, usually while performing acrobatics. Diving is an internationally recognised sport that is part of the Olympic Games. In addition, unstructured and non-competitive diving is a recreational pastime."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Diving_at_the_2016_Summer_Olympics_%E2%80%93_Men%27s_synchronized_10_metre_platform_3.jpg/330px-Diving_at_the_2016_Summer_Olympics_%E2%80%93_Men%27s_synchronized_10_metre_platform_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diving_(sport)"},{"title":"Waterfall","blocks":[{"text":"A waterfall is any point in a river or stream where water flows over a vertical drop or a series of steep drops. Waterfalls also occur where meltwater drops over the edge \nof a tabular iceberg or ice shelf. Waterfalls can be formed in several ways, but the most common method of formation is that a river courses over a top layer of resistant bedrock before falling onto softer rock, which erodes faster, leading to an increasingly high fall. Waterfalls have been studied for their impact on species living in and around them."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Cascada_Dynjandi%2C_Vestfir%C3%B0ir%2C_Islandia%2C_2014-08-14%2C_DD_136-138_HDR.JPG/330px-Cascada_Dynjandi%2C_Vestfir%C3%B0ir%2C_Islandia%2C_2014-08-14%2C_DD_136-138_HDR.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waterfall"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Tomb_of_hunting_and_fishing%2C_Monterozzi_necropolis%2C_Tarquinia%2C_Italy.jpg/500px-Tomb_of_hunting_and_fishing%2C_Monterozzi_necropolis%2C_Tarquinia%2C_Italy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Tomb_of_hunting_and_fishing%2C_Monterozzi_necropolis%2C_Tarquinia%2C_Italy.jpg/960px-Tomb_of_hunting_and_fishing%2C_Monterozzi_necropolis%2C_Tarquinia%2C_Italy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Tomb_of_hunting_and_fishing%2C_Monterozzi_necropolis%2C_Tarquinia%2C_Italy.jpg/500px-Tomb_of_hunting_and_fishing%2C_Monterozzi_necropolis%2C_Tarquinia%2C_Italy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATomb_of_hunting_and_fishing%2C_Monterozzi_necropolis%2C_Tarquinia%2C_Italy.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/The_Tomb_of_the_Diver_-_Paestum_-_Italy.JPG/500px-The_Tomb_of_the_Diver_-_Paestum_-_Italy.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/The_Tomb_of_the_Diver_-_Paestum_-_Italy.JPG/1280px-The_Tomb_of_the_Diver_-_Paestum_-_Italy.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/The_Tomb_of_th